07:34.910 --> 07:36.370
Luckily, you'll be okay.

07:36.410 --> 07:39.170
But you're going to have to
learn to live without a penis.

07:39.210 --> 07:41.440
Or will you?

07:41.480 --> 07:43.250
Oh, what's this?

07:43.280 --> 07:45.310
Is it... your penis?

07:45.350 --> 07:46.820
Nah, I'm just foolin'.

07:46.850 --> 07:49.520
I play that with my penis-less
patients to lighten the mood.

07:49.550 --> 07:51.620
Liev Schreiber gets a
big kick out of it.

07:51.660 --> 07:54.060
Doc, do you know who you're talking to?

07:54.090 --> 07:57.180
- That penis was my whole life!
- It's not so bad.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.879
At least you're not this pathetic guy

07:58.880 --> 08:00.406
who couldn't get his boat in the water.

08:00.430 --> 08:02.030
Have you seen this?

08:02.070 --> 08:04.770
You should take his wiener.
He's clearly not using it.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.770
Stop looking at us!

08:09.240 --> 08:13.409
Ah, that... that does... that
does make me feel better.

08:13.410 --> 08:15.980
_

08:22.720 --> 08:25.120
- What are we doing here?
- This is Pitbull's house.

08:25.160 --> 08:27.360
He knows everything about South Florida.

08:27.390 --> 08:28.890
He can help us find Mort.

08:28.930 --> 08:31.290
Doorbell, doorbell,

08:31.330 --> 08:32.630
doorbell, ring.

08:32.660 --> 08:34.000
It's my house.

08:34.030 --> 08:35.440
Esta mi casa.

08:36.240 --> 08:40.100
Wow. Imagine kind of
knowing two languages.

08:41.100 --> 08:43.040
Hang on. I'm in the
middle of writing a song.

08:43.270 --> 08:45.240
♪ Tingta tongka te tong tong tink. ♪

08:45.280 --> 08:46.780
That's a hit.

08:46.810 --> 08:49.140
What can I do for you,
my friends amigos?

08:49.180 --> 08:51.350
I told you. This guy's the real deal.

08:51.380 --> 08:53.500
We're looking for a friend
who's hiding out down here.

08:53.820 --> 08:56.180
He's a Jewish pharmacist
from Rhode Island.

08:56.220 --> 08:58.090
- Coral Palm Motel.
- Told you.

08:58.120 --> 09:00.120
And here's Pitbull with his newest hit,

09:00.160 --> 09:02.420
"Tingta Tongka Te Tong Tong Tink."

09:06.100 --> 09:08.160
Adios good-bye, amigo friends.

09:08.200 --> 09:11.630
I got to go get paid to scream
"Make some noise!" in Vegas.

09:21.380 --> 09:23.380
I think I hear Mort in the bathroom.

09:23.410 --> 09:25.150
Come on, urine, you can do this!

09:25.180 --> 09:27.650
It's just like your
toilet at home. Please!

09:27.680 --> 09:31.020
It's been five days now. Why
won't you just cooperate?!

09:31.100 --> 09:32.940
Is someone out there?

09:32.960 --> 09:34.066
Housekeeping!

09:34.090 --> 09:36.460
Oh, come on in. I'm just urinating.

09:36.490 --> 09:39.590
Tinkle, tinkle, splash, splash,
swoosh. Yeah, look at...

09:39.630 --> 09:41.760
Oh, boy, what a healthy stream!

09:41.840 --> 09:43.470
Will it ever end?

09:43.880 --> 09:45.600
What are you guys doing here?

09:46.680 --> 09:49.500
We're taking you back to
Quahog to collect our reward.

09:49.540 --> 09:51.570
Oh, no, I can't go back there!

09:51.610 --> 09:53.780
The mob will kill me!

09:53.810 --> 09:55.480
- Ha!
- What?

09:55.510 --> 09:58.310
A shark bit Quagmire's penis off.

09:58.350 --> 09:59.640
Ha.

10:03.450 --> 10:05.779
I can't believe it. This is horrible.

10:05.780 --> 10:07.760
