- Come on, now.

10:07.780 --> 10:09.680
Keep that enormous chin up, Glenn.

10:09.760 --> 10:11.130
There's lots you can do.

10:11.160 --> 10:13.090
You could devote your life to Christ,

10:13.130 --> 10:14.860
