the other exciting things

10:24.710 --> 10:27.060
- on the Internet besides porn.
- Like what?

10:27.160 --> 10:30.040
Well, uh, there's, uh...

10:30.080 --> 10:33.110
I like to research birds.
Try to learn a bird a day.

10:33.150 --> 10:34.750
Well, not that necessarily, but, uh...

10:34.790 --> 10:36.180
You got your robin.

10:36.220 --> 10:38.320
Wow, you really know your stuff, Joe.

10:38.360 --> 10:40.020
- Your swallow.
- Swallow?

10:40.060 --> 10:42.400
Uh, actually this is what
we're trying to avoid.

10:42.460 --> 10:43.499
You got your titmouse.

10:43.500 --> 10:45.230
Damn it, Joe, stop with the sex birds!

10:45.260 --> 10:47.240
Look, I appreciate what
you're trying to do, guys,

10:47.260 --> 10:48.630
