10:48.670 --> 10:50.770
You don't understand what
that penis meant to me.

10:50.800 --> 10:52.730
We did everything together.

10:52.770 --> 10:54.780
Absolutely everything.

10:54.910 --> 10:58.270
"As she tenderly unlaced
