12:03.640 --> 12:05.240
He birdied this hole yesterday.

12:05.280 --> 12:07.740
Is that right? Wow.

12:07.940 --> 12:10.610
And he hits a great
shot, right on the green.

12:10.650 --> 12:12.280
Yeah, yeah.

12:12.320 --> 12:15.860
How, uh... how do you win golf?

12:19.690 --> 12:21.890
We now return to HGTV's

12:21.930 --> 12:23.390
Couples Looking for a House

12:23.430 --> 12:25.990
Where the Woman Doesn't
Know the Guy's Gay.

12:26.030 --> 12:28.350
Well, I'm looking for a
place with good schools,

12:28.360 --> 12:29.800
and, because he works in the city,

12:29.830 --> 12:31.500
