12:31.530 --> 12:33.370
Yeah, she teaches here
at the high school

12:33.400 --> 12:36.340
and I work in town as a
choreographer and florist.

12:36.370 --> 12:38.710
And we'll probably need a nursery.

12:38.740 --> 12:40.580
Well, that's a discussion.

12:43.360 --> 12:45.040
- Oh, hey, Quagmire.
- Hey, Peter.

12:45.060 --> 12:46.500
I just came by to thank you

12:46.560 --> 12:48.196
