13:01.240 --> 13:04.099
Quagmire, we'd be delighted
to attend. Wouldn't miss it.

13:04.100 --> 13:06.170
Gosh, thanks, Peter. That means a lot.

13:06.200 --> 13:07.600
Okay, see you there.

13:07.870 --> 13:10.440
Damn it! Why did I even open the door?!

13:10.470 --> 13:12.210
Ugh!

13:12.240 --> 13:14.480
Getting excited.

13:14.510 --> 13:17.980
Now I got to go to this
thing! Ugh! Bite me!

13:18.010 --> 13:20.320
Laughing already just thinking about it.

13:20.680 --> 13:22.480
Only one way to get out of this!

13:34.160 --> 13:37.520
Oh, I'm so glad Quagmire's
back on his feet again.

13:38.320 --> 13:40.240
God, this is gonna be torture.

13:40.540 --> 13:42.080
Break a leg.

13:42.370 --> 13:43.440
Oh, hello.

13:43.470 --> 13:45.040
I didn't realize the curtain was up.

13:45.080 --> 13:48.040
And people think I'm the dummy.

13:48.080 --> 13:50.080
How is that doll talking?!

13:50.380 --> 13:51.980
I'm Glenn, and this is Edgar.

13:52.020 --> 13:54.920
What a great crowd, huh, Edgar?
This is gonna be a fun night.

13:54.950 --> 13:56.250
You call this fun?

13:56.290 --> 13:58.550
You're talking to a wooden
doll to make up for the fact

13:58.590 --> 14:00.250
that you can't have sex anymore.

14:00.290 --> 14:01.920
Come on, come on, Edgar.

14:01.960 --> 14:03.490
That's-that's not true.

14:03.530 --> 14:05.990
Besides, if you've got all the
answers, what do you suggest?

14:06.030 --> 14:07.430
Here's a suggestion.

14:07.460 --> 14:10.160
Blow your [BLEEP] brains out
in front of all these people.

14:10.430 --> 14:12.340
Is this, is this real?

14:12.600 --> 14:14.220
Oh, c-come on, Edgar.

14:14.260 --> 14:16.500
