14:18.070 --> 14:19.970
Well, then, maybe I can help.

14:20.010 --> 14:22.079
Quagmire, no!

14:22.080 --> 14:24.860
Oh, God, Peter's here. I so
don't want to talk to him.

14:25.180 --> 14:27.740
Hey, buddy. We got to catch up.

14:27.950 --> 14:29.950
Well, Edgar, if you think
that would be best.

14:29.990 --> 14:31.690
Yes, you'll be out of your misery.

14:31.720 --> 14:33.860
